{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2023-04-27 07:00:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER REPORTS Q1 2023 RESULTS AND REAFFIRMS GUIDANCE FOR 2023', 'text': 'COMPANY DELIVERS CONTINUED STRONG NET SALES MOMENTUM, LED BY U.S. REFRESHMENT BEVERAGES BURLINGTON, MASS. AND FRISCO, TEXAS , APRIL 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEURIG DR PEPPER INC. (NASDAQ: KDP) TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2023 AND REAFFIRMED ITS GUIDANCE FOR FULL YEAR CONSTANT CURRENCY NET SALES GROWTH OF 5% AND ADJUSTED DILUTED EPS GROWTH OF 6% TO 7%.'}